  "definition_ja": "f が [a, b] で連続、(a, b) で微分可能なら、f′(c) = (f(b) − f(a))/(b − a) となる c が a と b の間にあるという定理。",
  "definition_en": "If f is continuous on [a, b] and differentiable on (a, b), then f′(c) = (f(b) − f(a))/(b − a) for some c between a and b.",
